### Environment Variables ###
# Same split as mercury: *.env is ignored by default (local Vault-bootstrap bypass files
# like default.env / secrets/local.env), except config/*.env — that carries no credentials,
# only bootstrap identity (profile, Vault/Config Server URLs), and is meant to be versioned.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
!config/*.env

### OS ###
.DS_Store

### Python (.ai/bin tooling scripts) ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### Secrets / certs — never commit (see CLAUDE.md "What Not To Do") ###
# Real keystores/certs live under certs/backbone/ on disk (see pom.xml's <resources> for how
# they reach the classpath) and are never committed, matching mercury's own certs/mercury/.
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cert
*.crt
